{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-65","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：二项无理线段与中项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"The square on the side of the sum of two medial areas applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth the sixth binomial.","book":10,"number":65,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.65","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.65/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":65,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-65@raw-e7acbd611ceec0b6","contentId":"euclid-10-65","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e7acbd611ceec0b68e7b0a3f693d3697bded5744645cdebfafbb21c61ca00248","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-65.statement","euclid-10-65.construction.1","euclid-10-65.construction.2","euclid-10-65.proof.1","euclid-10-65.proof.2","euclid-10-65.proof.3","euclid-10-65.proof.4","euclid-10-65.proof.5","euclid-10-65.proof.6","euclid-10-65.proof.7","euclid-10-65.conclusion","euclid-10-65.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-65.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-65","revisionId":"euclid-10-65@raw-e7acbd611ceec0b6","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37b134dbbb6afbe16f385c97db1d4bb03c1188e4502b1e663b83ce443f84f2ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on the side of the sum of two medial areas applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth the sixth binomial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"用于有理线段的2 中项无理线段个区域之和的正方形个区域作为宽度为6 二项无理线段个。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-65.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-65","revisionId":"euclid-10-65@raw-e7acbd611ceec0b6","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f75e994f803b3a25006676c974cbb76fbf8047bc6fae8038bb430050a93dbf0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the side of the sum of two medial areas, divided at C, let DE be a rational straight line, and let there be applied to DE the parallelogram DF equal to the square on AB, producing DG as its breadth; I say that DG is a sixth binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB区域成为两个中项无理线段个区域之和的一边,将C区域分为C,将DE区域分为有理线段个区域,并将平行四边形 DF区域与AB区域中的正方形个区域相提并论,将DG区域扩大为宽度;我说,DG区域是第六条二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-65.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-65","revisionId":"euclid-10-65@raw-e7acbd611ceec0b6","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7217cfd7f0fec01d167e4188bde7d6bb5d9f57b4f9b48ec50785e047806a2f05","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the same construction be made as before."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样的工程 和以前一样"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-65.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-65","revisionId":"euclid-10-65@raw-e7acbd611ceec0b6","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a787e2b33d2001371c3e33909dbbcc49c701ffe5cdb600f673207835521f71a3","citations":["euclid-10-41"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AB is the side of the sum of two medial areas, divided at C, therefore AC, CB are straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial, the rectangle contained by them medial, and moreover the sum of the squares on them incommensurable with the rectangle contained by them, [[X. 41](/principles/euclid-10-41)] so that, in accordance with what was before proved, each of the rectangles DL, MF is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于AB是两个中项无理线段个区域之和的一面,面积为C,因此,AC,CB是正方形的直线不可公度,中项无理线段个直线,中项无理线段个直线矩形,不可公度个直线不可公度,不可公度个直线不可公度,不可公度个直线不可公度,矩形个直线矩形,矩形个直线矩形,矩形个直线矩形,MF直线中项无理线段。（相关点与线段：DL） [[X. 41](/principles/euclid-10-41)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-65.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-65","revisionId":"euclid-10-65@raw-e7acbd611ceec0b6","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72e1fd01830f53704d28670bbf9a2aa9c5725a17828d122f91d34154ef903ff6","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are applied to the rational straight line DE; therefore each of the straight lines DM, MG is rational and incommensurable in length with DE. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 DE;因此,DM直线、MG直线和不可公度直线各长DE。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-65.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-65","revisionId":"euclid-10-65@raw-e7acbd611ceec0b6","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0ce1231ef8e4228f13ce0e8ff56a50ea10b34b2f78a05b9bdcdcbc42cd3b514a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the sum of the squares on AC, CB is incommensurable with twice the rectangle AC, CB, therefore DL is incommensurable with MF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC正方形ACCB不可公度不可公度矩形矩形矩形ACCBCBDL不可公度ACACAC（相关点与线段：MF）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-65.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-65","revisionId":"euclid-10-65@raw-e7acbd611ceec0b6","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2be0e7ac3c8bceee106d10fa14764da321f3b679b15b69fecc64f07993b00f58","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11","euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DM is also incommensurable with MG; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)] therefore DM, MG are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore DG is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DM为不可公度,MG;DM为有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,DG为二项无理线段。 [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11) [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-65.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-65","revisionId":"euclid-10-65@raw-e7acbd611ceec0b6","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61a515c5a2a24deb32c2c878526fddddc05dbf64bd24f124528bfb778c322cbf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a sixth binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第六条二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-65.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-65","revisionId":"euclid-10-65@raw-e7acbd611ceec0b6","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"619e66b8e6e7822277f99675b1f0441657cae9154c2379122db72a522bfbab40","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly again we can prove that the rectangle DK, KM is equal to the square on MN, and that DK is incommensurable in length with KM; and, for the same reason, the square on DM is greater than the square on MG by the square on a straight line incommensurable in length with DM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,矩形 DK,KM等于MN,DK长度为不可公度,KM;同样,DM的正方形比MG的正方形,正方形等于不可公度线,DM。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-65.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-65","revisionId":"euclid-10-65@raw-e7acbd611ceec0b6","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"120dd3c0660aae87bbce7c0766f023e714a4b35f7cd98963fa9e9652c2738114","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And neither of the straight lines DM, MG is commensurable in length with the rational straight line DE set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DM,MG线中没有一个是长度可公度线 有理线段,DE线已经布置"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-65.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-65","revisionId":"euclid-10-65@raw-e7acbd611ceec0b6","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6acadb070a784ec21ec64f8c0f3622d5197a3609a2ed11dcc1ecd90ed7018425","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DG is a sixth binomial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DG是第六条二项无理线段直线,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-65.source","contentId":"euclid-10-65","revisionId":"euclid-10-65@raw-e7acbd611ceec0b6","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"51d0f3a6613baf3d689d43c2eedbbb7cc84a67b1aa41f01f732fc6fa0f9e09c6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.65/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.